# Every text file in this repo is LF, and must stay LF in the working tree too.
# Several tests read source files and match on "\n" (sync-perf.test.js pins
# call sites like "<MenuBar\n"; doc-anchors resolves line numbers), so a CRLF
# checkout — what `core.autocrlf=true` produces on Windows — failed them on
# untouched code. `eol=lf` overrides autocrlf for text files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
